–V19 and35 surviving mutations now GREEN; native Redis4 tests/29assertions/no skips GREEN. Requested single native review pending.\\\"\\n}\\n\",\"total_lines\":143}}","is_error":false},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-32ecf022-0e15-46f2-8aa2-78fb7ceb8f1b-11","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileTooLarge\":\"File content (32845 tokens) exceeds maximum allowed tokens (25000 tokens).\\nPlease use offset and limit parameters to read a shorter range, or use the 'grep' to search for specific content.\"}","is_error":true},{"type":"tool_result","tool_use_id":"call-32ecf022-0e15-46f2-8aa2-78fb7ceb8f1b-12","content":"{\"type\":\"ReadFile\",\"FileContent\":{\"content\":\"1→{\\n  \\\"$schema\\\": \\\"urn:swissknifeman:task:plan:decision:v1\\\",\\n  \\\"id\\\": \\\"D103\\\",\\n  \\\"title\\\": \\\"p07-stable-bc-admission-review (accepted)\\\",\\n  \\\"date\\\": \\\"2026-10-04\\\",\\n  \\\"status\\\": \\\"accepted\\\",\\n  \\\"decision\\\": \\\"1. D102 AccountStatusGate constructor change is a finite approved unpublished semantic delta under D64. Explicitly include scripts/bc/approved-deltas.json in P07.1 Files and scope. Preserve existing package entries; add tenancy entry at product execution only, bound to the resolved BC_CHECK_BASE revision actually used by bc-check (accepted-base.json by default), accepted D102/D103 source paths and exact SHA-256. Collect actual Roave JSON errors on the product candidate, approve only the declared constructor delta rows (description SHA-256, path, modificationType). No wildcard, invented hash, blanket exemption or base change. If any row is outside declared §4 surface, stop/fix; do not expand approvals silently. Golden regeneration and CHANGELOG alone do not admit stable BC. Same product commit carries CHANGELOG, php-api/Golden and finite approval. Rerun bc-check to exit 0 and preserve gate output. No stable bypass or checker change.\\\\n2. Dossier §4 explicitly names optional-policy → required five-argument constructor. P07.6 Scope/Validation covers D95/D96 with D98–D103 corrections, closed kernel enum 15→16 and this exact stable BC admission. Product tests and gates remain execution acceptance.\\\\n3. Remove unintended extra NullLogger argument from QueueTenantContext proof constructor; the logger belongs only to manager. PHP 8.4 accepts surplus arguments for this user-defined constructor, so the review's ArgumentCountError/current-proof-invalid assertion is not reproduced. Preserve raw report, record this evidence correction in triage, rerun current bodies/results. Add callback+cleanup with an initialized outer account to exercise actual previous-account restoration branch; current central scenario remains.\\\",\\n  \\\"rationale\\\": \\\"Stable packages require exact decision-bound Roave approval; scope and Golden prose alone cannot pass bc-check. Additional proof coverage must match current bodies and exercise outer restoration, while raw reviewer claims remain historical evidence to verify.\\\",\\n  \\\"applies_to\\\": [\\n10→    \\\"P07\\\",\\n    \\\"P07.1\\\",\\n    \\\"P07.6\\\"\\n  ],\\n  \\\"supersedes\\\": [],\\n  \\\"actor\\\": {\\n    \\\"provider\\\": \\\"legacy\\\",\\n    \\\"model\\\": \\\"designer/codex/GPT-6 (exact runtime selector/effort unavailable), same owner-authorized repair.\\\"\\n  },\\n  \\\"sections\\\": [\\n20→    {\\n      \\\"id\\\": \\\"Preamble\\\",\\n      \\\"title\\\": \\\"Preamble\\\",\\n      \\\"text\\\": \\\"---\\\\nid: D103\\\\ndate: 2026-10-04\\\\nstatus: accepted\\\\nitem: P07.1\\\\nitems: [P07, P07.1, P07.6]\\\\nsupersedes: []\\\\nsuperseded_by: null\\\\n---\\\"\\n    },\\n    {\\n      \\\"id\\\": \\\"D103-p07-stable-bc-admission-review-accepted\\\",\\n      \\\"title\\\": \\\"D103 — p07-stable-bc-admission-review (accepted)\\\",\\n      \\\"text\\\": \\\"**Actor:** designer/codex/GPT-6 (exact runtime selector/effort unavailable), same owner-authorized repair.\\\\n**Evidence:** RAG:— @plan/knowledge/artifacts-P07-grok-rereview-followup-report.json; scripts/bc-check.sh stable branch and scripts/bc/approved-delta.py; artifacts/P07-design-remediation/bc-admission-proof.py and rereview-contract-proof.php.\\\"\\n    },\\n30→    {\\n      \\\"id\\\": \\\"Solution\\\",\\n      \\\"title\\\": \\\"Solution\\\",\\n      \\\"text\\\": \\\"1. D102 AccountStatusGate constructor change is a finite approved unpublished semantic delta under D64. Explicitly include scripts/bc/approved-deltas.json in P07.1 Files and scope. Preserve existing package entries; add tenancy entry at product execution only, bound to the resolved BC_CHECK_BASE revision actually used by bc-check (accepted-base.json by default), accepted D102/D103 source paths and exact SHA-256. Collect actual Roave JSON errors on the product candidate, approve only the declared constructor delta rows (description SHA-256, path, modificationType). No wildcard, invented hash, blanket exemption or base change. If any row is outside declared §4 surface, stop/fix; do not expand approvals silently. Golden regeneration and CHANGELOG alone do not admit stable BC. Same product commit carries CHANGELOG, php-api/Golden and finite approval. Rerun bc-check to exit 0 and preserve gate output. No stable bypass or checker change.\\\\n2. Dossier §4 explicitly names optional-policy → required five-argument constructor. P07.6 Scope/Validation covers D95/D96 with D98–D103 corrections, closed kernel enum 15→16 and this exact stable BC admission. Product tests and gates remain execution acceptance.\\\\n3. Remove unintended extra NullLogger argument from QueueTenantContext proof constructor; the logger belongs only to manager. PHP 8.4 accepts surplus arguments for this user-defined constructor, so the review's ArgumentCountError/current-proof-invalid assertion is not reproduced. Preserve raw report, record this evidence correction in triage, rerun current bodies/results. Add callback+cleanup with an initialized outer account to exercise actual previous-account restoration branch; curren