utes, wire | Add schema-set SPI, registry/migrator commands and coded schema errors; remove provider schema-version constants and migration publish tags; add the tenancy wave schema dependency. Rebaseline PHP surface, console routes and safe error wire after the byte-stable contract update. |\\n30→| 2026-10-06 | PLAN3.P08.2 / D112 / D116 / D117 | php-surface | Remove the configurable database ID/table PHP surface; operations owns ResourceIdFormat, ResourceId format signatures replace the schema strategy and fromConfigured is removed. Wire formats remain unchanged. Remove obsolete ResolvesCoreOptions SPI bridge. Only php-surface regenerated. |\\n\",\"content_concise\":\"25→| 2026-10-04 | PLAN3.D95 / PLAN3.D98 / PLAN3.D64 | php-surface | P07.2: plain central Account/Domain, AccountRef template snapshot, removed vendor PHPStan rule and options; DatabaseTenantProvisioner/DatabaseTenantLifecycle and standalone template clone manager; ResolvesTenancyOptions model bridge. Named delta in plans/2026.09.27-№1-COREX-KERNEL/artifacts/P07.2-execution/golden-semantic-delta.json; routes/events/wire preserved |\\n| 2026-10-05 | PLAN3.D96 / PLAN3.D100 / PLAN3.D64 | php-surface | P07.3: +11 audit/impersonation port, value, profile and stock implementation types; four existing Internal/policy records changed. Named delta in plans/2026.09.27-№1-COREX-KERNEL/artifacts/P07.3-execution/golden-semantic-delta.json; routes/events/wire preserved. |\\n| 2026-10-05 | PLAN3.D96 / PLAN3.D98 / PLAN3.D100 / PLAN3.D64 | php-surface | P07.4: native access matrix/direct grants and RoleMatrixCompiled; five AzGuard implementation classes moved to unreleased access-azguard, own provider/registrar and typed bridge configuration; RoleView/RoleMatrixData/AuthOptions/PrincipalIdentity public removals with exact BC admission. Named delta in plans/2026.09.27-№1-COREX-KERNEL/artifacts/P07.4-execution/golden-semantic-delta.json; routes/events/wire preserved. |\\n| 2026-10-05 | PLAN3.D96 / PLAN3.D100 / PLAN3.D102